  "integration": {
    "placement": "Place the complete glTF scene in an instance group; ROOT is a skeleton lookup. Use SkeletonUtils.clone for skinned instances.",
    "gait": "In-place clips. Move the instance along +Z at clips.speed_mps times playback rate. Keep LOD1 during animated gameplay. No root motion is baked.",
    "sensor": "SENSOR_YAW is excluded from clips and remains engine-driven. Its local Y axis is the glTF up axis.",
    "hands": "SOCKET_HAND_L/R are grasp references; SOCKET_TOOL_L/R are forward accessory mounts. Carry_Walk_Cycle braces both forearms. Cargo is not included in the model.",
    "feet": "SOLE, HEEL and TOE sockets mark the contact plane 6 mm above ground. Flat support anchors the sole; heel placement and toe-off rotate about the respective socket. Flat-floor kinematic motion; terrain IK and collision belong to the game.",
    "bounds": "Use validation-report.json clip_envelopes for animated culling. Standing plot is 1.6 by 1.3 metres.",
    "damage": "D0 intact only; D1-D3 are not authored. Distance is a static map/loading stand-in, never an animated gameplay replacement.",
